<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn cattle market not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn cattle market not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not well tested, compared with Wednesday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Steers - Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1250 lbs 1.5 lds 113.00. Heifers - Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1150 lbs 1.5 lds 113.00.</p>
<p>Reported sales for Thurs - 100 Week to Date - 19,000</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720--</p>
